>>
Rule 2 (x must be a number-type tensor, excluding complex)
{x : tensor} |= dtype_(x) ≠ 10 ∧ dtype_(x) ≠ 11
>>
Rule 3 (y must be a number-type tensor, excluding complex)
{y : tensor} |= dtype_(y) ≠ 10 ∧ dtype_(y) ≠ 11
>>
Rule 4 (x must be one of the specified dtypes)
{x : tensor} |= dtype_(x) = 6 ∨ dtype_(x) = 7 ∨ dtype_(x) = 8 ∨ dtype_(x) = 1 ∨ dtype_(x) = 5 ∨ dtype_(x) = 2 ∨ dtype_(x) = 3 ∨ dtype_(x) = 4
>>
Rule 5 (check element of tensor x is larger than a constant)
{x : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(x,0)-1] : x[i] > -10
>>
Rule 6 (check element of tensor y is smaller than a constant)
{y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(y,0)-1] : x[i] < 10
>>
Rule 7 (x and y shapes should broadcast)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (ndim(x) = 0 ∧ ndim(y) = 0) ∨ (ndim(x) = ndim(y) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = shape(y, i)) ∨ (ndim(x) > ndim(y) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : shape(x, ndim(x) - ndim(y) + i) = shape(y, i) ∨ shape(y, i) = 1) ∨ (ndim(y) > ndim(x) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(y, ndim(y) - ndim(x) + i) = shape(x, i) ∨ shape(x, i) = 1)
>>
