>>
Rule 11 (x and y must have compatible shapes for broadcasting, using shape for broadcast)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= if ndim(x) > ndim(y) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) = 1 ∨ shape(y, i) = shape(x, ndim(x) - ndim(y) + i) else if ndim(y) > ndim(x) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = 1 ∨ shape(x, i) = shape(y, ndim(y) - ndim(x) + i) else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = shape(y, i)
